OL,3,AMedia outlets banned by Trump resume
OL,4,AWhite House coverage after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FRegular US television coverage resumed
OL,8,Fon Friday after the White House was
OL,9,Fforced to lift its ban of news outlets
OL,10,Fand readmit journalists from CNN, MS
OL,11,FNOW and Politico.
OL,13,FA federal judge had ruled on Thursday
OL,14,Fthat the ban was likely
OL,15,Funconstitutional and the administration
OL,16,Fhad to let them back in, at least for
OL,17,Fnow. Trump had barred them for what he
OL,18,Fcalled "fake news".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
