OL,3,AMedia outlets banned by Trump resume
OL,4,AWhite House coverage after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter the ruling on Thursday, the White
OL,8,FHouse still denied entry to some CNN
OL,9,Fand MS NOW reporters assigned to cover
OL,10,Farrivals for a state dinner for Chinese
OL,11,Fleader Xi Jinping.
OL,13,FBut on Friday, White House officials
OL,14,Fallowed reporters entry and coverage
OL,15,Fwent back to normal for the last day of
OL,16,FXi's visit with Trump in Washington.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
